          "en": "because we have a different port number there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 37.95,
          "en": "So it'll stop it. And why is important is because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.95,
