        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 61.74,
          "en": "And to do that, we are using CrossOrigin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 61.74,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "and we are specifying that from where",
