          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 65.52,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "So we are getting this request from localhost:3000.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.86,
          "en": "Of course, once you deploy, you will get a different URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 72.48,
          "en": "So you will allow it for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 72.48,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "So you will say, okay, whenever you get requests from this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 75.413,
          "en": "you have to allow it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 75.413,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "And sometime maybe you want your APIs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 78.81,
          "en": "to be public for the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "In that case you have to simply say CrossOrigin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 83.25,
          "en": "then it will allow for all the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 83.25,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "Okay, you can do that on each controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 87.24,
          "en": "the way I'm doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 90.81,
          "en": "Or you can do a configuration in the config file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 90.81,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "to allow from everywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 95.03999999999999,
          "en": "At this point, I'm not doing it, but that's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 95.03999999999999,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "So CrossOrigin simply means that if you are accessing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 99.72,
          "en": "the data from the outside world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 99.72,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "from this particular application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 102.99000000000001,
          "en": "then it'll by default blocked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 102.99000000000001,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "And if you want to allow it, you have to say CrossOrigin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "And also cause is basically one of these issues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 112.44,
          "en": "in the OS top 10, which we have discussed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "And that's how basically, Spring takes care of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "But yeah, we have used it by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 118.68,
          "en": "I have not explained to you when we were doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 118.68,
          "end": 121.41,
          "en": "or maybe you have done that, but not in terms of security.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 121.41,
          "end": 123.87,
